{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire world has declared war on God. In response, God has declared war on the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words -\u00a0<strong>it\u2019s time for\u00a0that fucking</strong>\u00a0<strong>crusade.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOLY Intentions</strong> is a fast-paced  FPS that\u00a0fuses together the relentless combat of Doom Eternal and Ultrakill with epic fantasy action inspired by titles like Elden Ring and Bloodborne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Crusader</strong>, destined to return the <strong>fear of God</strong> to this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/d5a9139098553101aa26e8374b6b379d.poster.avif?t=1774408346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/d5a9139098553101aa26e8374b6b379d.webm?t=1774408346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/d5a9139098553101aa26e8374b6b379d.mp4?t=1774408346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Majestic yet Brutal Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a <strong>Dragon</strong> that transforms into a <strong>Greatsword</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become invincible: <strong>heal by taking damage</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use over 40\u00a0<strong>devastating holy powers</strong>\u00a0- like turning enemy blood into guillotines or calling down Comets from divine trebuchets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with absolute <strong>aura</strong>: soar into the skies with\u00a0<strong>Flame,\u00a0walk on hurricanes, surf on lightning bolts</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through lightning, swords and explosions completely unscathed - just to\u00a0<strong>intimidate\u00a0</strong>your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Epic Blend Between Religion and Dark Fantasy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of Earth has been banished to\u00a0<strong>The Planet Graveyard</strong>\u00a0- a star system where dying worlds and fallen civilizations are exiled to rot. Across this cosmic necropolis, <strong>Gothic cathedrals and towering spires</strong> cast their shadows over kingdoms in ruin. Here, the <strong>Order of Majistos</strong> thrives, an ancient cult whose influence strangles every corner of existence<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After conquering the entire world, they wish to go even further - to usurp the throne of <strong>God</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear your way through vast mystical levels to hunt down and execute those who ruined the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/3f2609e991e0fda773d94447739ad944.poster.avif?t=1774408346\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/3f2609e991e0fda773d94447739ad944.webm?t=1774408346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/3f2609e991e0fda773d94447739ad944.mp4?t=1774408346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008930?t=1774408346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.c